ss="feature"><i class="bi bi-wifi"></i><h4 class="serif mt-3">Reliable Wi-Fi</h4><p class="muted">Stay connected throughout the hotel.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-4"><div class="feature"><i class="bi bi-headset"></i><h4 class="serif mt-3">Guest support</h4><p class="muted">Reception assistance for rooms, travel and transport.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-4"><div class="feature"><i class="bi bi-shield-check"></i><h4 class="serif mt-3">Connected operations</h4><p class="muted">Ready for future hotel management tools.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section id="destinations" class="section cream"><div class="container"><div class="eyebrow">Travel desk</div><h2 class="title mt-3 mb-5">The hotel is only the beginning.</h2><div class="row g-4"><div class="col-lg-4"><a class="travel-card d-block text-decoration-none" href="trips.php"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516426122078-c23e76319801?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=88" alt="Safari"><div class="caption"><div class="eyebrow">Wildlife</div><h3>Serengeti & Ngorongoro</h3></div></a></div><div class="col-lg-4"><a class="travel-card d-block text-decoration-none" href="trips.php"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1523805009345-7448845a9e53?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=88" alt="Kilimanjaro"><div class="caption"><div class="eyebrow">Mountain</div><h3>Kilimanjaro</h3></div></a></div><div class="col-lg-4"><a class="travel-card d-block text-decoration-none" href="trips.php"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1505881502353-a1986add3762?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=88" alt="Zanzibar"><div class="caption"><div class="eyebrow">Coast</div><h3>Zanzibar</h3></div></a></div></div></div></section><section id="transport" class="section"><div class="container"><div class="transport"><div class="row align-items-center g-4"><div class="col-lg-8"><div class="eyebrow">Guest transport</div><h2 class="title text-white mt-3">From the stend to your room.</h2><p class="text-white-50">Request bus stand or airport pickup and send the request directly to hotel reception on WhatsApp.</p></div><div class="col-lg-4 text-lg-end"><button class="btn btn-lightx" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#transportModal">Request transfer</button></div></div></div></div></section><section id="offers" class="section cream"><div class="container"><div class="offer"><div class="row align-items-center"><div class="col-lg-8"><div class="eyebrow">Weekly offer</div><h2 class="title mt-3">Two nights + transfer + travel desk.</h2><p class="muted">From TZS 420,000. Ask reception for current availability.</p></div><div class="col-lg-4 text-lg-end"><button class="btn btn-darkx" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#bookModal">Ask about it</button></div></div></div></div></section><footer class="footer"><div class="container"><div class="row g-4"><div class="col-lg-7"><div class="brand" style="color:#fff">Primonizer Hotel<small style="color:#aab2aa">STAY • DINE • EXPLORE</small></div><p class="mt-4">Stay comfortably. See more of Tanzania.</p></div><div class="col-6 col-lg-2"><b class="text-white">Hotel</b><a class="d-block mt-3" href="#rooms">Rooms</a><a class="d-block mt-2" href="#dining">Dining</a></div><div class="col-6 col-lg-3"><b class="text-white">Travel</b><a class="d-block mt-3" href="trips.php">Trips</a><a class="d-block mt-2" href="#transport">Transport</a></div></div></div></footer><div class="modal fade" id="bookModal" tabindex="-1"><div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered"><div class="modal-content"><div class="p-4"><div class="d-flex justify-content-between"><div><div class="eyebrow">Reservation</div><h3 class="serif mt-2">Book your stay</h3></div><button class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal"></button></div><form id="bookForm" class="mt-3"><input type="hidden" name="type" value="booking"><input id="roomField" name="room" class="form-control mb-3" placeholder="Room type" required><input name="name" class="form-control mb-3" placeholder="Full name" required><input name="phone" class="form-control mb-3" placeholder="Phone number" required><div class="row g-2"><div class="col-6"><input name="check_in" type="date" class="form-control" required></div><div class="col-6"><input name="check_out" type="date" class="form-control" required></div></div><input name="guests" type="number" min="1" value="2" class="form-control mt-3" required><button class="btn btn-darkx w-100 mt-3">Send reservation to WhatsApp</button></form></div></div></div></div><div class="modal fade" id="transportModal" tabindex="-1"><div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered"><div class="modal-content"><div class="p-4"><div class="d-flex justify-content-between"><div><div class="eyebrow">Guest transport</div><h3 class="serif mt-2">Request a transfer</h3></div><button class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal"></button></div><form id="transportForm" class="mt-3"><input type="hidden" name="type" value="transfer"><input name="name" class="form-control mb-3" placeholder="Your name" required><input name="phone" class="form-control mb-3" placeholder="Phone number" required><input name="pickup" class="form-control mb-3" placeholder="Bus stand / airport / location" required><div class="row g-2"><div class="col-6"><input name="date" type="date" class="form-control" required></div><div class="col-6"><input name="guests" type="number" min="1" value="1" class="form-control" required></div></div><button class="btn btn-darkx w-100 mt-3">Send transfer to WhatsApp</button></form></div></div></div></div><div id="toast" class="toast-msg alert alert-light border shadow"><b id="toastTitle">Request sent</b><div id="toastBody" class="small text-muted mt-1"></div></div><script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/jquery@3.7.1/dist/jquery.min.js"></script><script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script><script>$(function(){function send(form){let b=form.find('button').last(),old=b.text();b.prop('disabled',true).text('Sending...');let d={};form.serializeArray().forEach(x=>d[x.name]=x.value);$.ajax({url:'momo_order.php',method:'POST',contentType:'application/json',data:JSON.stringify(d),dataType:'json'}).done(function(r){if(r.ok){bootstrap.Modal.getOrCreateInstance(form.closest('.modal')[0]).hide();$('#toastTitle').text('Request sent');$('#toastBody').text('Reception has received your request on WhatsApp. Reference: '+r.reference);$('#toast').fadeIn().delay(5000).fadeOut()}else alert(r.message||'Could not send request.')}).fail(function(x){let m='Could not send request.';try{m=JSON.parse(x.responseText).message||m}catch(e){}alert(m)}).always(function(){b.prop('disabled',false).text(old)})}$('#bookForm,#transportForm').on('submit',function(e){e.preventDefault();send($(this))});$('.choose').on('click',function(){$('#roomField').val($(this).data('room'));bootstrap.Modal.getOrCreateInstance('#bookModal').show()});$('#availability').on('submit',function(e){e.preventDefault();$('#bookModal').modal('show')});});</script></body></html>